{"513710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SCUM", "steam_appid": 513710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5006300, 4635200, 4635240, 4635250, 4529160, 4635190, 3596770, 2841840, 2371620, 1990860, 2321800, 2517170, 2651720, 2651740, 2651750, 919680, 1643210, 2517160, 4062860, 4139450, 4369750], "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513710/extras/f0f109a7dafeb8b1efaaceb6038f54b2.avif?t=1787679410\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513710/extras_big/f0f109a7dafeb8b1efaaceb6038f54b2.webp?t=1787679410 width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Into the Wild continues in August with mutant bears, new Master Hunter quests and rewards, an underground TEC1 Research Facility, expanded Cooking and more:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutant Bears &amp; New Quests: </strong>Hunt mutant bears and claim new rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TEC1 Research Facility: </strong>Obtain a keycard to enter and survive what TEC1 has kept contained</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heatless Cooking:</strong> Prepare sandwiches and salads wherever you are</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Updated Food Effects: </strong>New effects, with greater benefits from proper meals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bug Fixes &amp; Improvements:</strong> More fixes, balance changes and quality-of-life updates</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the full update notes for every addition, fix, and balance adjustment.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513710/extras/790878898ba057af8ba520f503cb0d8a.avif?t=1787679410\" alt=\"Welcome to SCUM Island!\" width=600 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to SCUM, a ruthless open-world survival game where prisoners are dropped onto a vast, hostile island and forced to survive by any means necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision shapes who you become and how long you last. Scavenge, loot, craft, hunt, build and fight for every advantage as you adapt to a world that wants you dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alive. Stay dangerous. Become something harder to kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513710/extras/7e308693f70d0bf5989353e743da7cc3.poster.avif?t=1787679410\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513710/extras/7e308693f70d0bf5989353e743da7cc3.webm?t=1787679410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513710/extras/7e308693f70d0bf5989353e743da7cc3.mp4?t=1787679410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Survival Game With Teeth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCUM is built on deep, interconnected survival systems that give every choice weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your health, survival skills, metabolism, and fatigue are all shaped by an intricate progression system that defines how long you last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you’re not alone out here. Former contestants re-animated as Puppets   shamble across the land, mutated experiments twisted into monsters lurk in the dark, and every other player has the same goal as you: Survive long enough to leave a mark. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk-taking, high-stakes and tragedy all make for a great show. In SCUM your actions directly shape how you are perceived through the world’s reputation system.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team-up or go it alone. SCUM gives you the systems, what you do with them is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513710/extras/59ac1f5ca132461bae472afab7aa2087.poster.avif?t=1787679410\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513710/extras/59ac1f5ca132461bae472afab7aa2087.webm?t=1787679410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513710/extras/59ac1f5ca132461bae472afab7aa2087.mp4?t=1787679410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped on a vast and dangerous island built for opportunity and discovery, so scavenge what you need and craft what you don’t have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCUM’s 225㎢ map is inspired by all aspects of Croatian territory. Sprawling across beautiful Adriatic coastline, lush forests and harsh freezing mountain sides. Explore high-security military zones and hidden corners of the island, all offering something worth claiming or something worth fearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prisoners who look beyond the next meal may begin to understand what’s really going on here, if they live long enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can survive here, you can survive anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513710/extras/5a98c95e3c0e0c3d66613b4689d9f2ff.poster.avif?t=1787679410\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513710/extras/5a98c95e3c0e0c3d66613b4689d9f2ff.webm?t=1787679410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513710/extras/5a98c95e3c0e0c3d66613b4689d9f2ff.mp4?t=1787679410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive open world with diverse and dangerous environments </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep character customization, metabolism and survival simulation systems </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex crafting, looting and base building </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP and PvE with no fixed progression path </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent character development and skill growth </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A live-broadcast survival premise with real attitude </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ongoing development with expanding systems and world depth</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513710/extras/8158aac43bb858309fdf38bfbce88141.poster.avif?t=1787679410\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513710/extras/8158aac43bb858309fdf38bfbce88141.webm?t=1787679410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513710/extras/8158aac43bb858309fdf38bfbce88141.mp4?t=1787679410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class