u: Survive long enough to leave a mark. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk-taking, high-stakes and tragedy all make for a great show. In SCUM your actions directly shape how you are perceived through the world’s reputation system.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team-up or go it alone. SCUM gives you the systems, what you do with them is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513710/extras/59ac1f5ca132461bae472afab7aa2087.poster.avif?t=1787679410\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513710/extras/59ac1f5ca132461bae472afab7aa2087.webm?t=1787679410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/513710/extras/59ac1f5ca132461bae472afab7aa2087.mp4?t=1787679410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped on a vast and dangerous island built for opportunity and discovery, so scavenge what you need and craft what you don’t have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCUM’s 225㎢ map is inspired by all aspects of Croatian territory. Sprawling across beautiful Adriatic coastline, lush forests and harsh freezing mountain sides. Explore high-security military zones and hidden corners of the island, all offering something worth claiming or something worth fearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prisoners who look beyond the next meal may begin to understand what’s really going on here, if they live long enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can survive here, you can survive anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline